`run()`/`repl()` both gain `working_dir=os.getcwd()`,
`allowed_commands=None`, `shell_timeout=30`, `mud=None` keyword
parameters, mirroring Ruby's new params exactly (including the
`working_dir: Dir.pwd` *default-to-cwd*, distinct from `working_dir:
